msgid "Secure privileged Thread with incoming PRIMASK set only. Caller excludes all other region/selector users and keeps NMI/HardFault outside this metadata. Requires reviewed SAU region support. Does not modify CTRL, ALLNS, another region, another security world's registers or enable the SAU. Current RNR is restored; DSB/ISB complete region writes. Policy, secure gateways and IDAU configuration stay external."
msgstr "Secure privileged Thread with incoming PRIMASK set only. Caller excludes all other region/selector users and keeps NMI/HardFault outside this metadata. Requires reviewed SAU region support. Does not modify CTRL, ALLNS, another region, another security world's registers or enable the SAU. Current RNR is restored; DSB/ISB complete region writes. Policy, secure gateways and IDAU configuration stay external."

