msgid "Privileged Thread mode, incoming PRIMASK=1, BASEPRI and FAULTMASK clear. SCR.SLEEPDEEP must be clear. The caller owns the final readiness check and timer/wake source. WFI wakes for a pending enabled interrupt despite PRIMASK; the interrupt runs after the caller restores its saved mask. No register, mask, clock or pending interrupt is changed. Current CPU/security state only; no physical HIL claim."
msgstr "Privileged Thread mode, incoming PRIMASK=1, BASEPRI and FAULTMASK clear. SCR.SLEEPDEEP must be clear. The caller owns the final readiness check and timer/wake source. WFI wakes for a pending enabled interrupt despite PRIMASK; the interrupt runs after the caller restores its saved mask. No register, mask, clock or pending interrupt is changed. Current CPU/security state only; no physical HIL claim."

msgid "OK after wake, CONTEXT or UNSUPPORTED without sleeping."
msgstr "OK after wake, CONTEXT or UNSUPPORTED without sleeping."

msgid "Privileged Thread mode with all incoming masks clear. Saves PRIMASK, performs acquire observation under that mask, optionally sleeps, and restores the exact mask. Publishers must be same-CPU configurable IRQs or Threads; NMI/HardFault, DMA, SMP and other security-world publishers are excluded. The caller keeps storage alive, owns an enabled IRQ timer for finite deadlines, and retries the authoritative predicate after wake. Native is unsupported."
msgstr "Privileged Thread mode with all incoming masks clear. Saves PRIMASK, performs acquire observation under that mask, optionally sleeps, and restores the exact mask. Publishers must be same-CPU configurable IRQs or Threads; NMI/HardFault, DMA, SMP and other security-world publishers are excluded. The caller keeps storage alive, owns an enabled IRQ timer for finite deadlines, and retries the authoritative predicate after wake. Native is unsupported."

msgid "[in] Naturally aligned, shared 32-bit wake sequence."
msgstr "[in] Naturally aligned, shared 32-bit wake sequence."

msgid "[in] Snapshot before the caller's readiness check."
msgstr "[in] Snapshot before the caller's readiness check."

msgid "[out] True only when WFI was executed."
msgstr "[out] True only when WFI was executed."

